                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>A draft resolution (S/654) proposing establishment of a three-member commission
                    of the Security Council and defining its composition and functions was submitted
                    by the Council’s President, the Belgian Representative, and adopted at the 230th
                    meeting on January 20. For text and discussion of the draft resolution, see SC,
                        <hi rendition="#italic">3rd yr., Nos. 1–15</hi>, pages 129–143.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
